      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per game, instead of shooting any weapon in the Shooting phase, this model can use its smoke launchers. Until the controlling player&apos;s next Shooting phase, any enemy units targeting this unit subtract 1 from all hit rolls for Shooting attacks made against this unit.</characteristic>
