          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Shooting phase, each time this model is selected to shoot, its Hammerfall heavy bolter array or its Hammerfall heavy flamer array can target, and resolve attacks against, every eligible enemy unit. Each time this model fires overwatch, it only resolves attacks with its weapons against the charging unit, but when doing so the Type of its Hammerfall heavy bolter array is changed to Heavy 6, and the type of its Hammerfall heavy flamer array is changed to 2D6</characteristic>
