          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Use this Stratagem before the battle: Select one BLACK TEMPLARS model from your army that has the word &apos;Sergeant&apos; or &apos;Sword Brother&apos; in their profile. Add 1 to that model&apos;s Attacks and Wounds characteristics and improve that model&apos;s Weapon Skill by 1. You can only use this Stratagem once</characteristic>
