          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Capacity" typeId="15aa-1916-a38b-d223">This model can transport 10 &lt;CHAPTER&gt; INFANTRY models. Each JUMP PACK, WULFEN or TERMINATOR model takes the space of two models, and each CENTURION model takes the space of 3 models. It cannot transport PRIMARIS models.</characteristic>
