                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When resolving an Overwatch attack made by a model in a friendly&lt;CHAPTER&gt; unit within 6&quot; of a model from your army with this Relic, a hit roll of 5 or 6 scores a hit.</characteristic>
