                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">TECHMARINE only. When a model with this Relic uses their Blessing of the Omnissiah ability, roll two dice when determining how many lost wounds are regained and discard one of the results</characteristic>
