                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of a model with this Relic. In addition, when a Morale test is taken for a &lt;CHAPTER&gt;unit within 6&quot; of a friendly model with this Relic, do not roll the dice; it is automatically passed</characteristic>
