                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When you give a model this Relic, select one bolt weapon (see Codex: Space Marines) that model is equipped with. When that model is chosen to shoot with, you can choose for that weapon to fire a korvidari bolt. If you do, when choosing targets for that model and when choosing ranged weapons, that weapon’s Range characteristic is increased by 6&quot; and it can target units that are not visible to the bearer, but only one attack can be made with that weapon</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
