                    <characteristic name="D" typeId="ae8a-3137-d65b-4ca7">2</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Each time an attack made with this weapon is allocated to a model in a CHAOS unit, that attack has a Damage characteristic of 3. Each time an attack made with this weapon is allocated to a model in a CHAOS MONSTER unit, that attack has a Damage characteristic of 4.</characteristic>
