                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In the Psychic phase, each time a model in the bearer&apos;s unit would lose a wound as a result of a mortal wound, roll one D6; on a 4+, that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
