                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">• Each time the bearer makes an attack, a hit roll of 2+ is always successful (including when firing Overwatch), irrespective of any modifiers or abilities the target may have.
