                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When you give a model this Relic, select one bolt weapon (see Codex: Space Marines) that model is equipped with. Each time the bearer shoots with that weapon, you can choose for it to fire a bolt of judgement. If you do, you can only make one attack with that weapon, but that attack has an Armour Penetration characteristic of -2 and a Damage characteristic of 3. When making that attack, unless the target is a VEHICLE or MONSTER unit, a wound roll of 2+ is always successful.</characteristic>
