                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Primaris model only. Add 3&quot; to the range of the bearer&apos;s aura abilities (to a maximum of 9&quot;). This does not increase the range of aura abilities that are psychic powers.</characteristic>
