              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time an attack is made against the bearer, your opponent cannot reroll the hit roll, cannot reroll the wound roll and cannot reroll the damage roll.
The bearer has the follwing ability: The Emperor&apos;s Judgement [Aura]: While an enemy unit is within 6&quot; of the bearer, each time a Morale test is taken for that unit, roll one addtional D6 and discard the lowest result</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
