              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a ranged attack is made against a unit with this tactic, if the attacker is more than 18&quot; away, the unit with this tactic is treated as having the benefits of light cover against that attack.</characteristic>
