                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Models with this tactic whose characteristics can change as they suffer damage are considered to have double the number of wounds remaining for the purposes of determining what those characeristics are.</characteristic>
