              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When you select this tactic, select one of the following Faction keywords: CHAOS KNIGHTS, TYRANIDS, AELDARI, ORK, HERETIC ASTARTES, NECRONS, T’AU EMPIRE. Each time a model with this tactic makes a melee attack against a unit with that Faction keyword, re-roll a hit roll of 1.</characteristic>
