              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a unit with this tactic is selected to shoot or fight, you can re-roll one hit roll when resolving that unit&apos;s attacks.</characteristic>
