              <description>When resolving an attack made against a unit with this tactic, an unmodified wound roll of 1 or 2 always fails, irrespective of any abilities that the weapon or the model making that attack may have.

In addition, when a Psychic test or Deny the Witch test is taken for a PSYKER model with this tactic, re-roll any or all dice rolls of 1.</description>
            </rule>
